config IR_PIKO_CIR
	tristate "piko consumer IR (Zaurus IrDA transceiver)"
	depends on RC_CORE && PXA25x
	help
	  Drives the Sharp Zaurus IrDA transceiver as a 38 kHz consumer
	  infrared port, so the device can read remote controls and act
	  as one. Transmit bit-bangs the transceiver's TXD pin; receive
	  demodulates the carrier in software off an edge interrupt on
	  RXD. Mutually exclusive with pxaficp_ir, which owns the same
	  pins and the same transceiver.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called piko-cir.
